# Design exploration from the Console redesign — kept locally for reference,
# not part of the site. Regenerate with tools/ if ever needed again.
design-*.html
design.html
tools/

# Backups written by tools/adopt_console.py
index.html.bak-*

# Local scratch
_*.html

# Raw Reddit text pulled by scripts/fetch_reddit.py.
#
# The 75-day gap alone is ~45 MB gzipped and five years would be ~1.4 GB, which is not a
# git repository. It is also the one thing here that *is* re-fetchable — Arctic Shift
# holds it, the script is committed, and the day files are content-addressed by date — so
# the durable artefact is the counts derived from it, not the text.
#
# The two calibration days are the exception and stay tracked, because the comparison in
# scripts/compare_counts.py is only reproducible with them.
data/reddit/*

# Local preview config for the Claude Code browser pane, not part of the project.
.claude/
